# Basic .gitignore Syntax

# Examples
# secrets.txt   Ignores any file named secrets.txt anywhere in the repo
# *.log         Ignores all .log files anywhere
# build/        Ignores the build directory (trailing / means directory only)
# /TODO         Ignores TODO only in the root, not in subdirectories
# doc/*.txt     Ignores .txt files directly inside doc/, but not doc/sub/a.txt
# doc/**/*.txt  Ignores .txt files anywhere under doc/ (any depth)
# **/logs       Ignores a directory named logs anywhere in the tree

# Wildcards
# *      Matches anything except a slash
# ?      Matches any one character except a slash
# [abc]  Matches one character from the set
# **     Matches across directory boundaries (any depth)